  - m_Id: 867233796
    m_Localized: Start
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 867233797
    m_Localized: Game purpose
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 867233798
    m_Localized: 'In Nazi Germany during World War II, submarines called unlimited
      submarines were being operated to cause damage to the enemy economy. <br>

      The
      purpose of this game is to lead a submarine as captain of the German submarine
      U-BOAT during World War II and sink the enemy ship by torpedo attack.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 867233799
    m_Localized: Game mode
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 867233800
    m_Localized: Game modes include "Skirmish" and "Mission".
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 867233801
    m_Localized: '"Skirmish" is intended for short gameplay, and the game starts
      with you already deep inside the enemy convoy.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 867233802
    m_Localized: Survive attacks from destroyers and try to sink merchant ships.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 867233803
    m_Localized: A "mission" begins with searching for enemies.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 867233804
    m_Localized: Use periscope depth to locate enemy convoy, approach them quietly,
      and try to sink the merchant ships.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 867233805
    m_Localized: Difficulty
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 867233806
    m_Localized: Depending on the difficulty, the number of enemy ships and the number
      of sinking tons required for clearing will change.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 867233807
    m_Localized: Number of destroyers
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 867233808
    m_Localized: Number of merchant ships
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 867233809
    m_Localized: Number of sinking tons
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 867233810
    m_Localized: Operation explanation
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 867233811
    m_Localized: Submarine movement
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 867233812
    m_Localized: "To move the submarine, do it from the controlled panel at the lower
      left.\n The control panels include \"engine telegraph\", \"direction instructor\",
      and \"depth indicator\", and you can change the engine output, travel direction,
      and depth of the submarine by operating each."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 867233813
    m_Localized: Watching, hearing sound
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 867233814
    m_Localized: 'You can check the surrounding status from the instruction panel
      at the bottom right. <br>

      By tapping each button, the information of
      the enemy ship confirmed in the upper left message panel is displayed. <br>

      You
      can visually watch the look -imized buttons on the left, and to hear the hydropone
      with the central listening button. <br>

      Visually lookouts can only be
      used when submarines are emerging and hyprophones are diving.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 867233815
    m_Localized: Periscope screen
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 867233816
    m_Localized: 'You can display the periscope screen by tapping the periscope button
      on the right side of the instruction panel on the lower right. <br>

      On
      the deterrent mirror screen, you will check the enemy ship with the periscope,
      input torpedo specifications, and launch torpedoes.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 867233817
    m_Localized: Double -speed display
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 871428096
    m_Localized: 'You can change the progress of the in -game time with the time
      -ratio button in the upper right status panel. <br>

      The time magnification
      can be changed to 1 to 16 times.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 871428097
    m_Localized: Action of enemy ships
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 871428098
    m_Localized: 'The enemy fleet usually continues to move towards the destination
      at a constant speed. <br>

      However, once a submarine is found, the anti
      -submarine sailing is entered, merchant ships proceed to avoid torpedoes, and
      the destroyer starts attacking the submarine. <br>

      There are two types
      of destroyers attacking, and if the submarine is emerging, a bombardment will
      be attacked, and a striking attack will be performed during submarine.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 871428099
    m_Localized: Battery, oxygen remaining
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 871428100
    m_Localized: 'Submarines gradually decrease the battery level to turn the screw
      with the battery. <br>

      If the battery runs out, you will not be able
      to move forward and retreat, but you can dive and rise. <br>

      During
      the voyage, the amount of oxygen remains gradually decreases due to consuming
      oxygen in the submarine. <br>

      If the amount of oxygen is 0, the game
      will be over, so please come up and recover.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 871428101
    m_Localized: Save function
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 871428102
    m_Localized: 'You can save the state by tapping the end button at the top right
      during the game, and the game can be resumed from the continuation button on
      the title screen. <br>

      In addition, the state is automatically saved
      every minute in the game time.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
